# Eitri boot options, read by U-Boot on every boot from this partition.
# One name=value per line; lines starting with '#' are ignored. Only the two
# names below are used and anything else in this file is ignored.
#
# Extra kernel command line arguments, for example to get a console while
# debugging on the bench. uart2 is wired to an MCU on the printer, so do not
# enable a console on it with a printer attached:
#   eitri_extra_bootargs=console=ttyS2,1500000 earlycon
#
# Force the root filesystem slot (A or B) and skip the attempt counters. This is
# the recovery switch if both slots are marked bad. Remove the line afterwards.
#   eitri_force_slot=A
